\left(\frac{2}{5}\right) \left(\frac{3}{5}\right) + \left(\frac{3}{5}\right) \left(\frac{2}{5}\right) = 2 \left(\frac{2}{5}\right) \left(\frac{3}{5}\right) = \frac{12}{25}
